{"seq":1,"slug":"vite-integration","title":"Vite 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/ecosystem-and-patterns/vite-integration","wordCount":509,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"vite-集成\">Vite 集成</h1><h2 id=\"vue-的默认构建工具\">Vue 的默认构建工具</h2><p>Vite 是 Vue 生态的官方构建工具，由 Vue 作者尤雨溪创建。它利用浏览器原生 ES Module 实现极速的开发服务器启动，同时使用 Rollup 进行优化的生产构建。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Dev[&quot;开发模式&quot;]&#10;        S[&quot;源代码&quot;] --&gt; |&quot;原生 ESM&quot;| B[&quot;浏览器&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Prod[&quot;生产构建&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;源代码&quot;] --&gt; |&quot;Rollup&quot;| Bundle[&quot;优化后的 Bundle&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Dev[\"开发模式\"]\n        S[\"源代码\"] --&gt; |\"原生 ESM\"| B[\"浏览器\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Prod[\"生产构建\"]\n        S2[\"源代码\"] --&gt; |\"Rollup\"| Bundle[\"优化后的 Bundle\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>原生 ESM 开发服务器</strong>：开发模式下浏览器直接加载源码模块，省去打包步骤，因此启动极快。</li>\n<li><strong>生产构建</strong>：构建时改用 Rollup 做完整打包与优化，开发与生产两套管线各取所长。</li>\n<li><strong>HMR（热模块替换）</strong>：文件变更后只替换受影响的模块，模板与样式改动可保留组件内部状态。</li>\n<li><strong>环境变量</strong>：仅 <code>VITE_</code> 前缀的变量会被注入客户端，其余保留在构建环境中不外泄。</li>\n<li><strong>依赖预构建</strong>：<code>optimizeDeps</code> 把 CommonJS 依赖预先转成 ESM 并缓存，减少请求数与转换开销。</li>\n<li><strong>插件钩子</strong>：<code>transform</code>、<code>configureServer</code>、<code>generateBundle</code> 等钩子构成自定义插件的扩展点。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vue-插件配置\">Vue 插件配置</h2><h3 id=\"基本配置\">基本配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// vite.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;vite&#39;;&#10;import vue from &#39;@vitejs/plugin-vue&#39;;&#10;import vueJsx from &#39;@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    vue({&#10;      script: {&#10;        defineModel: true,&#10;        propsDestructure: true,&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;    vueJsx(),&#10;  ],&#10;  resolve: {&#10;    alias: {&#10;      &#39;@&#39;: &#39;/src&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// vite.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@vitejs/plugin-vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vueJsx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    vue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      script: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        defineModel: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        propsDestructure: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    vueJsx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolve: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alias: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/src'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常用插件\">常用插件</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>插件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@vitejs/plugin-vue</code></td>\n<td>Vue SFC 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx</code></td>\n<td>JSX/TSX 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unplugin-auto-import</code></td>\n<td>API 自动导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unplugin-vue-components</code></td>\n<td>组件自动注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vite-plugin-vue-devtools</code></td>\n<td>增强 DevTools</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unplugin-vue-router</code></td>\n<td>类型安全路由</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// vite.config.ts — 自动导入示例&#10;import AutoImport from &#39;unplugin-auto-import/vite&#39;;&#10;import Components from &#39;unplugin-vue-components/vite&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    vue(),&#10;    AutoImport({&#10;      imports: [&#39;vue&#39;, &#39;vue-router&#39;, &#39;pinia&#39;],&#10;      dts: &#39;src/auto-imports.d.ts&#39;,&#10;    }),&#10;    Components({&#10;      dirs: [&#39;src/components&#39;],&#10;      dts: &#39;src/components.d.ts&#39;,&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// vite.config.ts — 自动导入示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoImport </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unplugin-auto-import/vite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Components </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unplugin-vue-components/vite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    vue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    AutoImport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      imports: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vue-router'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dts: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/auto-imports.d.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Components</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dirs: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/components'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dts: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/components.d.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"hmr-热模块替换\">HMR（热模块替换）</h2><p>Vite 的 HMR 基于原生 ESM，对 Vue SFC 有深度集成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Edit[&quot;修改 .vue 文件&quot;] --&gt; Detect[&quot;Vite 检测变化&quot;]&#10;    Detect --&gt; Q{&quot;变化类型?&quot;}&#10;    Q -- &quot;template&quot; --&gt; TR[&quot;模板热更新&quot;]&#10;    Q -- &quot;script&quot; --&gt; SR[&quot;重新执行 setup&quot;]&#10;    Q -- &quot;style&quot; --&gt; CR[&quot;CSS 热替换&quot;]&#10;    TR --&gt; U[&quot;视图更新(保留状态)&quot;]&#10;    SR --&gt; U&#10;    CR --&gt; U\">flowchart LR\n    Edit[\"修改 .vue 文件\"] --&gt; Detect[\"Vite 检测变化\"]\n    Detect --&gt; Q{\"变化类型?\"}\n    Q -- \"template\" --&gt; TR[\"模板热更新\"]\n    Q -- \"script\" --&gt; SR[\"重新执行 setup\"]\n    Q -- \"style\" --&gt; CR[\"CSS 热替换\"]\n    TR --&gt; U[\"视图更新(保留状态)\"]\n    SR --&gt; U\n    CR --&gt; U</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变化类型</th>\n<th>HMR 行为</th>\n<th align=\"center\">状态保留</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&lt;template&gt;</code></td>\n<td>重新渲染模板</td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;style&gt;</code></td>\n<td>替换样式表</td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code></td>\n<td>重新执行 setup</td>\n<td align=\"center\">❌（部分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS Modules</td>\n<td>替换模块</td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"环境变量\">环境变量</h2><p>Vite 使用 <code>.env</code> 文件管理环境变量，以 <code>VITE_</code> 为前缀的变量暴露给客户端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .env&#10;VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com&#10;VITE_APP_TITLE=My Vue App&#10;DB_PASSWORD=secret  # 不会暴露给客户端\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VITE_API_BASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://api.example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VITE_APP_TITLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">My</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vue</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> App</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DB_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">secret</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 不会暴露给客户端</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// env.d.ts — 类型声明&#10;interface ImportMetaEnv {&#10;  readonly VITE_API_BASE: string;&#10;  readonly VITE_APP_TITLE: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ImportMeta {&#10;  readonly env: ImportMetaEnv;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// env.d.ts — 类型声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;