code>configureServer</code> 等钩子扩展构建行为</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Vite 集成","id":"vite-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Vue 的默认构建工具","id":"vue-的默认构建工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Vue 插件配置","id":"vue-插件配置"},{"level":3,"text":"基本配置","id":"基本配置"},{"level":3,"text":"常用插件","id":"常用插件"},{"level":2,"text":"HMR（热模块替换）","id":"hmr-热模块替换"},{"level":2,"text":"环境变量","id":"环境变量"},{"level":2,"text":"构建优化","id":"构建优化"},{"level":3,"text":"代码分割","id":"代码分割"},{"level":3,"text":"依赖预构建","id":"依赖预构建"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义插件开发","id":"自定义插件开发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nuxt 部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/nuxt-deployment"},"next":{"title":"Vue 组件测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/ecosystem-and-patterns/testing-vue-components"}}